      "t": "interlude",
      "text": "the derby",
      "sub": "Small Wood · August · a hip bar · the flats",
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Crab derby off the pier. Numbers painted on the shells, a chalk line across the boards, everybody leaning over it."
    },
    {
      "t": "show",
      "char": "faust",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "pos": "left"
    },
    {
      "t": "show",
      "char": "jacob",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "pos": "center"
    },
    {
      "t": "show",
      "char": "wagner",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "pos": "right"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Jacob",
      "expr": "amused",
      "text": "Shots all around."
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Wagner",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "None for me ginger beer thanks"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Faust",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Twenty bucks says it's the same crab."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Everybody laughs. The winner comes over the chalk sideways, slow. Its number is zero."
    },
    {
      "t": "cg",
      "src": "assets/cg/vol4_meld_facet_derby_zero.jpg",
      "caption": "number 0"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Jacob",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "But aren't we already I mean look at us"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Wagner",
      "expr": "warm",
      "text": "living in this land of milk honey."
    },
